Trakt Community Watch Provider for Silo

This is an independent derivative of the Silo Trakt watch-provider plugin,
distributed under AGPL-3.0-only. The original LICENSE is included unchanged.
This plugin is not published or supported by Silo Server or Trakt.

Original source:
https://github.com/Silo-Server/silo-plugin-watchprovider-trakt
Base commit: fd0fa8138dc6ba4bd5caa29f9b5497bce5c3863d

Includes the optional client-secret change and regression coverage proposed
by Quick104 in PR #3 (commit 7af98f7d821ada1aece967f5ab4885f9892fdddf):
https://github.com/Silo-Server/silo-plugin-watchprovider-trakt/pull/3
The original patch credits Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>.

Community changes (2026-10-16): separate plugin/module identity and user agent,
community-facing presentation, required client-ID schema, reproducible release
packages with source, independent CI/release workflows, and reconnection docs.

The Trakt protocol capability remains "trakt"; the plugin ID is now
"community.watchprovider.trakt". These are separate identities in Silo.

When redistributing binaries, provide the corresponding modified source under
the included license. The package command creates a matching source archive.
